#taxon[Observation]
#title[Loop space of FinSet_n]

The groupoid of finite sets with cardinality $n$, $"FinSet"_n$ is pointed connected with base point $[n] := {0,1,...,n-1}$. Its loop space is the symmetric group $S_n$.
$
  Omega ("FinSet"_n, [n]) ~= S_n.
$

In other words $"FinSet"_n ~= B S_n$

